#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:5 b4178605e5734475a39e69af4cb68477
msgid "DisplayPort OSD"
msgstr "DisplayPort OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:6 d3cbef775d974a2faf6f4ee60c45cb22
msgid ""
"DisplayPort, is an MSP protocol extension that allows an autopilot to "
"remotely draw text on compatible external OSDs. DisplayPort, is an MSP "
"protocol extension that allows to remotely draw text characters/icons on "
"compatible external OSDs and allows High Definition (HD) as well as Standard"
" Definition (SD) displays."
msgstr ""
"DisplayPort是MSP协议的扩展，允许飞控远程在兼容的外部OSD上绘制文字。DisplayPort是MSP协议扩展，支持远程在兼容外部OSD上绘制文字字符/图标，并兼容高清（HD）和标清（SD）显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:8 6d2d35989f404e4c9897deae3aa6bfe4
msgid ""
"HDZero, Walksnail, and DJI with WTF-OSD modifications are capable of "
"DisplayPort operation."
msgstr "HDZero、Walksnail以及经WTF-OSD改装的DJI支持DisplayPort操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:10
#: 5df3b86f51a445b6ae067d31a8c1a9e4
msgid ""
"on F4 based autopilots, with extremely crowded OSDs (ie many panels), it is "
"possible that if the UART used does not have DMA, that display corruption, "
"artifacts, etc. can occur. In this rare case, move the DisplayPort "
"connection to a UART that does have DMA."
msgstr ""
"在基于F4的飞控上，当OSD面板极多时，若所用UART不支持DMA，可能出现显示损坏、伪影等现象。在这种罕见情况下，请将DisplayPort连接迁移至支持DMA的UART。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:13
#: 6c2e6756bc384cbaa40300dd4b21ef8f
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

