"DisplayPort OSDs can render all the panel items supported by the ArduPilot's"
" onboard OSD. Features such as multiple screen switching, multiple units and"
" statistics are supported as well. Please refer to the :ref:`onboard OSD "
"documentation <common-osd-overview>`  for more info.  DisplayPort based OSDs"
" include:"
msgstr ""
"DisplayPort OSD可渲染ArduPilot机载OSD支持的所有面板项目，还支持多屏切换、多单位制和统计等功能。详情请参阅 "
":ref:`机载OSD文档 <common-osd-overview>`。基于DisplayPort的OSD包括："

