#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:69
#: 592455cea05a45b492cbaa3127331f8d
msgid "OSD Panel Item Configuration"
msgstr "OSD面板项目配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:70
#: f21d4c32896a4e80a91c86d0a4fceade
msgid "Each OSD panel item uses a set of three variables to be set:"
msgstr "每个OSD面板项目需设置三个变量："

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:72
#: 0d5f583ccdcc45ebbb75cfe29140b0ea
msgid ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_EN`` - activates the respective panel item on screen \"n\" "
"when set to 1."
msgstr "``OSDn_<ITEM>_EN`` — 设为1时在屏幕「n」上激活对应面板项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:73
#: b59e862dae724b2f9ee8fa005d6c1bc9
msgid ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_X`` and ``OSDn_<ITEM>_Y`` set the horizontal and vertical "
"position of the item, starting with ``X = 0`` and ``Y = 0`` in the upper "
"left corner of your screen."
msgstr ""
"``OSDn_<ITEM>_X`` 和 ``OSDn_<ITEM>_Y`` 设置项目的水平和垂直位置，以屏幕左上角 ``X = 0``、``Y = "
"0`` 为原点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:75
#: cb19883c638d499faef05dbe025c7b27
msgid ""
"the positioning parameters are not used for MSP telemetry only OSDs that "
"create the display only using the telemetry values."
msgstr "位置参数不适用于仅基于遥测值创建显示的MSP遥测OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:77
#: 83ff2545a521406597293b7b3de0931c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot calculates a sensor-less airspeed estimate that is used if no "
"sensor is present or fails. ARSPD_TYPE must be set to zero in order to "
"display this value as the airspeed item, if no sensor is present."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot会计算无传感器空速估计值，在无传感器或传感器失效时使用。若无传感器，必须将ARSPD_TYPE设为零才能将该值显示为空速项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:82
#: 76246607a89b45498d363e7d5089c15a
msgid "Display Resolution and Fonts"
msgstr "显示分辨率与字体"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:83
#: dc579903f9b04c999db32d0977348cd4
msgid ""
"When using DisplayPort, you can select to display either the SD or HD fonts "
"using ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` for each OSD screen enabled. 0 = SD (30x16), 1 = HD "
"(50x18), 3 = HD (60x22)."
msgstr ""
"使用DisplayPort时，可通过为每个已启用的OSD屏幕设置 ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` 来选择显示SD或HD字体。0 = "
"SD（30×16），1 = HD（50×18），3 = HD（60×22）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:85
#: c0d0671c21c94e9fb4f03e684cc24e3e
msgid ""
"For HDZero you should set ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` to 0 or 1 for each enabled OSD "
"screen. If you set it to 2, the text displayed will be garbled."
msgstr "对于HDZero，每个已启用的OSD屏幕应将 ``OSDx_TXT_RES`` 设为0或1。若设为2，显示文字将出现乱码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:87
#: 8592bb8d79264fb788f04a7fba3103f5
msgid ""
"The SD font's positions are set on a 30x16 X/Y position grid as normal, the "
"HD uses a (1) 50x18 or (2) 60x22 grid. The 50x18 grid has margins at the "
"top/bottom/left/right of the screen before the grid begins."
msgstr ""
"SD字体位置按正常的30×16 X/Y位置网格设置，HD使用（1）50×18或（2）60×22网格。50×18网格在屏幕四周留有边距，然后才开始网格。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:89
#: ae444f120b8d47cd9f8241761e37d036
msgid ""
"ArduPilot compatible fonts for WTFOS modified DJI goggles can be found "
"`**HERE** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WTFOS-"
"DJI>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"适用于WTFOS改装DJI眼镜的ArduPilot兼容字体可在 `**此处** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WTFOS-"
"DJI>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:91
#: 5f59e151e65743648f4102f3a6b980e1
msgid ""
"Walksnail/Avatar HD Goggles can select which font they use via a goggle "
"menu. A set of different style fonts that are ArduPilot compatible can be "
"found `**HERE** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WalkSnail>`__"
" . The following image shows the font styles included."
msgstr ""
"Walksnail/Avatar HD眼镜可通过眼镜菜单选择字体。一组ArduPilot兼容的不同风格字体可在 `**此处** "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_OSD/fonts/HDFonts/WalkSnail>`__"
" 找到。下图展示了包含的字体风格。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:97
#: 1423445c13e14aaa95584ffe70dae9b5
msgid "Screens and screen switching"
msgstr "屏幕与屏幕切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:98
#: c7480deeca7944b7a091153870cc1a93
msgid ""
"For multiple screen layouts, each screen's \"OSD\" parameter label is "
"trailed by a number, starting with \"1\". For example,  ``OSDn_<ITEM>_x`` is"
" a parameter \"x\" associated with screen 1's \"ITEM\" panel."
msgstr ""
"对于多屏幕布局，每个屏幕的「OSD」参数标签后跟一个数字，从「1」开始。例如，``OSDn_<ITEM>_x`` "
"是与屏幕1的「ITEM」面板关联的参数「x」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:100
#: 74342eafb5ed4f498bbe0063f315064a
msgid ""
"multiple screen layout switching is not avaialable on MSP telemetry only "
"OSDs unless the OSD itself provides the capability themselves."
msgstr "多屏幕布局切换在仅MSP遥测OSD上不可用，除非OSD本身提供该功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:102
#: b41c61d29c79489c9e62e9fc8666c6a8
msgid ""
"Set ``OSDn_<ITEM>_EN`` =1 to enable screen \"n\" display of this item. This "
"allows one to set individual items active on one screen but have them "
"switched off on another screen. Up to 4 screens are optionally available, "
"and can be individually enabled."
msgstr ""
"将 ``OSDn_<ITEM>_EN`` =1 "
"可启用屏幕「n」对该项目的显示。这样可以在一个屏幕上激活某些项目，而在另一个屏幕上关闭它们。最多可选用4个屏幕，每个均可单独启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:103
#: 480e8a7fb84b4c9683d1d809de7fdf4f
msgid ""
"Set parameters ``OSDn_CHAN_MIN`` and ``OSDn_CHAN_MAX`` to adjust RC channel "
"pwm limits to use for switching to a respective screen. Be sure to have the "
"ranges non-overlapping."
msgstr ""
"设置参数 ``OSDn_CHAN_MIN`` 和 ``OSDn_CHAN_MAX`` "
"来调整用于切换到相应屏幕的RC通道PWM限制值。请确保各范围不重叠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:105
#: 6d3a629afd3a4549be7c8856c37de5c6
msgid ""
"There are different switch-method options to meet individual RC systems "
"switch layout requirements. These can be set by parameter: "
":ref:`OSD_SW_METHOD<OSD_SW_METHOD>`. The options are:"
msgstr ""
"提供不同的切换方式选项以满足各种RC系统拨档布局需求。可通过参数 :ref:`OSD_SW_METHOD<OSD_SW_METHOD>` 设置，选项为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:108
#: d11ebd4660fb4692bb8e884d9d790f82
msgid ""
"0 = switches to next screen if the set RC channel's "
"(:ref:`OSD_CHAN<OSD_CHAN>`) value is changed"
msgstr "0 = 当设定RC通道（:ref:`OSD_CHAN<OSD_CHAN>`）的值发生变化时切换到下一屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:109
#: 67d76272e91a45558ef7c0b3ef02b4ae
msgid ""
"1 = directly selects a screen based on the set pwm limits for each "
"respective screen. RC channel value must change for new pwm value to be "
"recognized."
msgstr "1 = 根据每个屏幕设定的PWM限制直接选择屏幕。RC通道值必须改变才能识别新的PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:110
#: 109ee5414d164b72bf402d28f45f30d4
msgid ""
"2 = toggles screens on a low to high transition of set RC channel. keeps "
"toggling to next screen every second while channel value is kept high"
msgstr "2 = 在设定RC通道从低到高跳变时切换屏幕。当通道值保持高电平时，每秒持续切换到下一屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:112
#: 2c9be65ae8dc4ad5aa8e05d710aecd06
msgid ""
"A limitation of telemetry based OSDs is that there's no way for ArduPilot to"
" add new panel items at will, it's the vendor's responsibility to add new "
"features by rolling out new firmware releases."
msgstr "基于遥测的OSD的一个限制是ArduPilot无法随意添加新面板项目，新功能的添加依赖厂商推出新固件版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:115
#: 731c57d7085d463f9930d08aa0f53802
msgid "Displaying statistics on a dedicated screen"
msgstr "在专用屏幕上显示统计信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:116
#: 0c8e5aca104e4a7db7e83c6330f1e50e
msgid ""
"Displaying statistics on a dedicated screen requires enabling at least one "
"extra screen by setting the respective ``OSDn_ENABLE`` to 1. By default, "
"ArduPilot has only one screen active so in a typical setup one would set "
"(:ref:`OSD2_ENABLE<OSD2_ENABLE>`) = 1 and then enabling the OSD stats panel "
"on screen 2 by setting (:ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>`) = 1."
msgstr ""
"在专用屏幕上显示统计信息需要通过将相应 ``OSDn_ENABLE`` "
"设为1来启用至少一个额外屏幕。默认情况下ArduPilot仅有一个活动屏幕，典型设置是将（:ref:`OSD2_ENABLE<OSD2_ENABLE>`）="
" 1，然后通过设置（:ref:`OSD2_STATS_EN<OSD2_STATS_EN>`）= 1在屏幕2上启用OSD统计面板。"

